{
 "_readme": [
  "The one place for colour, type, shape and motion. Edit a value, then run python tools/theme.py (build_map.py does this too).",
  "assets/tokens.css is generated from this file and every page loads it first. Never write a colour in a stylesheet or a script: tools/stylelint.py fails the build.",
  "colours_both_modes: the same in light and dark. light / dark: the values that differ by mode. aliases: names that point at other tokens, so old rules keep working.",
  "Change the look: edit 'accent' for the brand colour, 'bg' / 'surface' / 'ink' for the palette, '--r' for corner radius, '--top' for the header height."
 ],
